#: ../../reference/signals.rst:6 ebb6664138a647ba8dd28909d6d9048c
msgid ""
"Django includes a `signal dispatcher "
"<https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/4.2/topics/signals/>`_ that allows "
"adding reactions on certain actions easily. Besides `djangos built-in "
"signals <https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/4.2/ref/signals/>`_ juntagrico"
" sends the signals below."
msgstr ""
"Django beinhaltet einen `Signal-Dispatcher "
"<https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/4.2/topics/signals/>`_, der das "
"Hinzufügen von Reaktionen auf bestimmte Aktionen einfach macht. Neben "
"`Djangos integrierten Signalen "
"<https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/4.2/ref/signals/>`_ sendet Juntagrico "
"die unten stehenden Signale."

